                                                "sense_id": "694f38d3-d0a6-3c82-ae40-35800f83796b",
                                                "text": "She swayed slightly in the gusts, bent supply to them and seemed at one with the force which Straup found so hostile."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "abeca389-0b53-4ac3-a324-2e93f9d67e72",
                                                "sense_id": "694f38d3-d0a6-3c82-ae40-35800f83796b",
                                                "text": "Grigory hesitantly took her in his arms to kiss her, but she held him off, bent supply backwards and shot a frightened glance at the windows.\n'They'll see!'\n'Let them!'\n'I'd be ashamed—'"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
